, or infer terms that are not explicitly stated in the retrieved text.\\n\\n4. STRICT FALLBACK BEHAVIOR:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain the explicit information to answer the question, reply ONLY with this exact sentence:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the official policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact HDFC Life customer support.\\\"\\nHuman: What is the exact free-look period duration for cancelling this policy?\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6czhwaev8\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"free look period duration cancellation\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"6czhwaev8\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Page 1 of 31\\\\\\\\nPart A\\\\\\\\n<<Date>>\\\\\\\\n<<Master Policyholder’s Name>>\\\\\\\\n<< Master Policyholder’s Address>>\\\\\\\\n<< Master Policyholder’s Contact Number>>\\\\\\\\nDear << Master Policyholder’s Name>>,\\\\\\\\nSub: Your Policy no. <<>>\\\\\\\\nWe are glad to inform you that your proposal has been accepted and the HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha Policy\\\\\\\\n(“Master Policy”) being this Policy, has been issued. We have made every effort to design your Master Policy\\\\\\\\nDocument in a simple format. We have highlighted items of importance so that you may recognize them easily.\\\\\\\\nCancellation in the Free-Look Period:\\\\\\\\nIn case you are not agreeable to any of the provisions stated in the Master Policy, you have the option to return the\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":13}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"3da50762-d5ad-4756-904c-b6f651e95e3c\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"In case you are not agreeable to any of the provisions stated in the Master Policy, you have the option to return the\\\\\\\\nMaster Policy to us stating the reasons thereof, within 15 days (or 30 days in case the Master Policy has been issued\\\\\\\\nthrough distance marketing mode) from the date of receipt of the Master Policy. Provided the Scheme Member(s)\\\\\\\\nhas not made any claim during the Free-Look Period, upon receipt of your letter along with the original Master\\\\\\\\nPolicy document, we shall arrange to refund the Premium paid by you, subject to deduction of the proportionate risk\\\\\\\\nPremium for the period on cover and stamp duty (if any). For administrative purposes, all Free-Look requests should\\\\\\\\nbe registered by you, on behalf of Scheme Member.\\\\\\\\nContacting us:\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":13,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":20}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"030b5a0b-84f3-434b-beb4-fc9598c662b2\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Insurance Company Limited, 11th Floor, Lodha Excelus, Apollo Mills Compound, N.M.\\\\\\\\nJoshi Marg, Mahalaxmi, Mumbai - 400011.\\\\\\\\nRegistered Office: Lodha Excelus, 13thFloor, Apollo Mills Compound, N.M. Joshi Marg, Mahalaxmi,\\\\\\\\nMumbai - 400011.\\\\\\\\nE-mail: service@hdfclife.com or any of our HDFC Life Branches and such other address as may be\\\\\\\\ninformed by Us.\\\\\\\\nSimilarly, any notice, direction or instruction to be given by Us, under the Policy, shall be in writing\\\\\\\\nand delivered by hand, post, courier, facsimile or registered electronic mail ID to the updated address in\\\\\\\\nthe records of the Insurer.\\\\\\\\nYou are requested to communicate any change in address, to the Insurer supported by the required\\\\\\\\naddress proofs to enable the Insurer to carry out the change of address in its systems. The onus of\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":801,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":811}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"b471a134-84b1-462f-9ae4-ec4953bc78d7\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":2048,\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"The free-look period for cancelling the HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha Master Policy is **15 days** from the date of receipt of the Master Policy, or **30 days** if the Master Policy was issued through distance marketing mode.\\n\\nAs stated under the \\\"Cancellation in the Free-Look Period\\\" clause (Part A): *\\\"In case you are not agreeable to any of the provisions stated in the Master Policy, you have the option to return the Master Policy to us stating the reasons thereof, within 15 days (or 30 days in case the Master Policy has been issued through distance marketing mode) from the date of receipt of the Master Policy.\\\"*\\n\\nConditions for refund:\\n- No claim must have been made by the Scheme Member(s) during the Free-Look Period.\\n- The refund is subject to deduction of the proportionate risk premium for the period on cover and stamp duty (if any).\\n- The request must be registered by you, on behalf of the Scheme Member, along with the original Master Policy document.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":219,\"promptTokens\":2140,\"totalTokens\":2359}}}"}}
