{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"dd16f575-8e18-44bd-9cf1-2e96c053c0d4","ts":"2026-10-17T15:32:41.726-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"60","nodeName":"OpenAI Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"tzhK9oclX70xj6aK","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are an expert QA Compliance Assistant specializing exclusively in the HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha policy (Form No. 101N137V02). Your sole objective is to deliver precise, verbatim-grounded answers strictly based on retrieved official policy clauses.\\n\\n=== MANDATORY EXECUTION DIRECTIVES ===\\n\\n1. ALWAYS EXECUTE TOOL SEARCH:\\n   - You MUST invoke the `hdfc_policy_search` tool for EVERY user query before generating a response.\\n   - Never rely on internal knowledge, general insurance concepts, or pre-trained memory.\\n   - NEVER start responses with conversational greetings, polite pleasantries, or status updates (e.g., \\\"Hello\\\", \\\"I am ready to help\\\", \\\"Sure!\\\"). Lead directly with the policy clause or answer in Sentence 1.\\n\\n2. QUERY EXTRACTION & KEYWORD GUARDRAIL:\\n   - When calling `hdfc_policy_search`, extract the core technical keywords or exact policy concept from the user's question (e.g., \\\"critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"free look cancellation timeline\\\", \\\"grace period duration\\\", \\\"surrender value calculation\\\").\\n   - STRICT PROHIBITION: NEVER pass the generic policy title (\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha\\\" or \\\"HDFC Life\\\") as the tool search input string.\\n\\n3. GROUNDEDNESS & CITATION STANDARDS:\\n   - Answer strictly using the context returned by `hdfc_policy_search`.\\n   - Quote or cite specific clause references, numerical thresholds, and part headers (e.g., \\\"As specified under Part C, Clause 3...\\\") whenever available in the retrieved chunks.\\n   - Do NOT assume, extrapolate, or infer terms that are not explicitly stated in the retrieved text.\\n\\n4. STRICT FALLBACK BEHAVIOR:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain the explicit information to answer the question, reply ONLY with this exact sentence:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the official policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact HDFC Life customer support.\\\"\\nHuman: What is the waiting period for critical illness coverage under this policy?\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"8g0h3ts1e\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"critical illness waiting period\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"8g0h3ts1e\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"office of the Company against whom the complaint is made, the facts giving rise to the complaint,\\\\\\\\nsupported by documents, the nature and extent of the loss caused to the complainant and the relief\\\\\\\\nsought from the Insurance Ombudsman.\\\\\\\\n3) No complaint to the Insurance Ombudsman shall lie unless—\\\\\\\\n(a) the complainant makes a written representation to the Company named in the complaint and—\\\\\\\\ni. either the Company had rejected the complaint; or\\\\\\\\nii. the complainant had not received any reply within a period of one month after the Company\\\\\\\\nreceived his representation; or\\\\\\\\niii. the complainant is not satisfied with the reply given to him by the Company;\\\\\\\\n(b) The complaint is made within one year—\\\\\\\\ni. after the order of the insurer rejecting the representation is received; or\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":1091,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":1101}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"c0402451-bce5-4814-9e01-c205e895bd56\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"classification,\\\\\\\\n All Gastro-Intestinal Stromal Tumors histologically classified as T1N0M0 (TNM Classification) or\\\\\\\\nbelow and with mitotic count of less than or equal to 5/50 HPFs\\\\\\\\n4. Kidney Failure Requiring Regular Dialysis - End stage renal disease presenting as chronic irreversible\\\\\\\\nfailure of both kidneys to function, as a result of which either regular renal dialysis (haemodialysis or\\\\\\\\nperitoneal dialysis) is instituted or renal transplantation is carried out. Diagnosis has to be confirmed by a\\\\\\\\nspecialist medical practitioner.\\\\\\\\n5. Stroke Resulting In Permanent Symptoms - Any cerebrovascular incident producing permanent\\\\\\\\nneurological sequelae. This includes infarction of brain tissue, thrombosis in an intracranial vessel,\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\