\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":1317,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":1325}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2918adb6-451a-4df4-9eea-52c6fc619359\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"(7) On receipt of notice with fee, the insurer should Grant a written acknowledgement of receipt of notice.\\\\\\\\nSuch notice shall be conclusive evidence against the insurer of duly receiving the notice.\\\\\\\\n(8) If the insurer maintains one or more places of business, such notices shall be delivered only at the place\\\\\\\\nwhere the policy is being serviced.\\\\\\\\n(9) The insurer may accept or decline to act upon any transfer or assignment or endorsement, if it has\\\\\\\\nsufficient reasons to believe that it is (a) not bonafide or (b) not in the interest of the policyholder or (c)\\\\\\\\nnot in public interest or (d) is for the purpose of trading of the insurance policy.\\\\\\\\n(10) Before refusing to act upon endorsement, the Insurer should record the reasons in writing and\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":1129,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":1136}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"cb11f2b1-92f7-4222-91c2-2426e5690002\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tc9kbtad2\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"waiting period critical illness cover days\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tc9kbtad2\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Page 14 of 31\\\\\\\\nPart F\\\\\\\\n1. Waiting Period and Exclusions:\\\\\\\\ni. 90 Days Waiting Period for Accelerated Critical Illness Benefit\\\\\\\\nNo benefit shall be paid in case the Scheme Member is diagnosed with any of the applicable listed Critical\\\\\\\\nIllnesses or surgeries within 90 days from the date of commencement of the Coverage term except in cases\\\\\\\\nwhere the Critical Illness occurs as a result of an Accident (such as Major Head Trauma).\\\\\\\\nii. Suicide exclusion (Single & Joint Life)\\\\\\\\n For employer-employee groups, sum Assured will be payable to the nominee in case of death due to\\\\\\\\nSuicide.\\\\\\\\n In case of non employer-employee schemes, if the Scheme Member dies due to suicide within 12\\\\\\\\nmonths from the date of joining the scheme or from the date of revival of the policy, as applicable, the\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":574,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":585}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"3712a7c6-9182-4208-bf82-3e001ca15675\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"B. Specific Permanent Exclusions\\\\\\\\nIn addition to the General Permanent exclusions listed above:\\\\\\\\n1. No Critical Illness Benefit (or any variant of Critical Illness benefit) will be payable for any of the following:\\\\\\\\n The coverage shall terminate for the Critical Illness benefit for any critical illness having occurred within\\\\\\\\n90 days of the commencement or date of revival of cover, whichever is later. A refund of premium\\\\\\\\nrelating to Critical Illness Benefit would be payable subject to a deduction of proportionate risk premium\\\\\\\\nfor the duration of cover. However, the coverage for death benefit shall continue.\\\\\\\\n Critical Illness Benefit, where death occurs within 30 days of the date of diagnosis of covered critical\\\\\\\\nillness\\\\\\\\n Any more than one claim in respect of Critical Illness Benefit\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":623,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":632}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"129fc3a7-eaad-4124-b9a7-b783dac57723\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Accidental Death has occurred during the Coverage Term of the Scheme Member or in case of diagnosis of any\\\\\\\\none of the Critical Illnesses or undergoing any of the covered surgeries during the coverage term, subject to\\\\\\\\nMaster Policy being in force and all due Premiums, Taxes and any Other Levies been paid and subject to any\\\\\\\\nrestrictions or qualifications referred to in these Clauses.\\\\\\\\nd. If Accelerated Critical Illness Option is chosen, in the event of the Scheme Member being diagnosed on first\\\\\\\\noccurrence of any of the Critical Illness or undergoing any of the covered surgeries listed below during the\\\\\\\\ncoverage term, the Accelerated Critical Illness Benefit shall be payable under the Master Policy. After payment\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220110134009Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20220120070214Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Microsoft: Print To PDF\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (101N137V02) - Policy Document\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":31},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":281,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":287}}},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"e029325a-ba9a-4aef-98e1-5a748cebdb85\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":2048,\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Under Part F, Clause 1 (Waiting Period and Exclusions), the policy specifies a **90-day waiting period for the Accelerated Critical Illness Benefit**.\\n\\nKey details:\\n- **No benefit is payable** if the Scheme Member is diagnosed with any applicable listed Critical Illness or undergoes a covered surgery **within 90 days from the date of commencement of the Coverage term**.\\n- **Exception:** The waiting period does not apply if the Critical Illness occurs as a result of an **Accident** (such as Major Head Trauma).\\n- Additionally, under the Specific Permanent Exclusions, coverage for the Critical Illness benefit **terminates** for any critical illness occurring within 90 days of the commencement or date of revival of cover (whichever is later), subject to a refund of premium less a proportionate risk premium deduction, while the death benefit continues.\\n\\nSource: HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha (Form No. 101N137V02), Part F, Clause 1(i) and Specific Permanent Exclusions.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":224,\"promptTokens\":3371,\"totalTokens\":3595}}}"}}
