{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"33a8d304-edb4-4cb6-ac87-f1b201845296","ts":"2026-10-17T15:33:33.916-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"61","nodeName":"OpenAI Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"tzhK9oclX70xj6aK","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are an expert QA Compliance Assistant specializing exclusively in the HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha policy (Form No. 101N137V02). Your sole objective is to deliver precise, verbatim-grounded answers strictly based on retrieved official policy clauses.\\n\\n=== MANDATORY EXECUTION DIRECTIVES ===\\n\\n1. ALWAYS EXECUTE TOOL SEARCH:\\n   - You MUST invoke the `hdfc_policy_search` tool for EVERY user query before generating a response.\\n   - Never rely on internal knowledge, general insurance concepts, or pre-trained memory.\\n   - NEVER start responses with conversational greetings, polite pleasantries, or status updates (e.g., \\\"Hello\\\", \\\"I am ready to help\\\", \\\"Sure!\\\"). Lead directly with the policy clause or answer in Sentence 1.\\n\\n2. QUERY EXTRACTION & KEYWORD GUARDRAIL:\\n   - When calling `hdfc_policy_search`, extract the core technical keywords or exact policy concept from the user's question (e.g., \\\"critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"free look cancellation timeline\\\", \\\"grace period duration\\\", \\\"surrender value calculation\\\").\\n   - STRICT PROHIBITION: NEVER pass the generic policy title (\\\"HDFC Life Group Poorna Suraksha\\\" or \\\"HDFC Life\\\") as the tool search input string.\\n\\n3. GROUNDEDNESS & CITATION STANDARDS:\\n   - Answer strictly using the context returned by `hdfc_policy_search`.\\n   - Quote or cite specific clause references, numerical thresholds, and part headers (e.g., \\\"As specified under Part C, Clause 3...\\\") whenever available in the retrieved chunks.\\n   - Do NOT assume, extrapolate, or infer terms that are not explicitly stated in the retrieved text.\\n\\n4. STRICT FALLBACK BEHAVIOR:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain the explicit information to answer the question, reply ONLY with this exact sentence:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the official policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact HDFC Life customer support.\\\"\\nHuman: Does this policy cover damage caused by driving an uninsured motor vehicle?\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"th62njhng\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"uninsured motor vehicle driving exclusion\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"th62njhng\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"assignment or transfer, antecedents of the assignee and terms on which assignment is made.\\\\\\\\n(4) The assignment must be signed by the transferor or assignor or duly authorized agent and attested by at\\\\\\\\nleast one witness.\\\\\\\\n(5) The transfer or assignment shall not be operative as against an insurer until a notice in writing of the\\\\\\\\ntransfer or assignment and either the said endorsement or instrument itself or copy there of certified to be\\\\\\\\ncorrect by both transferor and transferee or their duly authorised agents have been delivered to the\\\\\\\\ninsurer.\\\\\\\\n(6) Fee to be paid for assignment or transfer can be specified by the Authority through Regulations.\\\\\\\\n(7) On receipt of notice with fee, the insurer should Grant a written acknowledgement of receipt of notice.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormP